s: &lt;a href=\"https:\/\/t.me\/youthbreaktheboundaries\/\"&gt;Youth Break the Boundaries Telegram channel&lt;\/a&gt;  &lt;a href=\"https:\/\/t.me\/worldyouthfestival\"&gt;World Youth Fest Telegram channel&lt;\/a&gt;  &lt;\/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Subscribe &lt;a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/@ybbfoundation\"&gt;YBB YouTube channel &lt;\/a&gt; &lt;\/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Tag 5 of your friends and @youthbreaktheboundaries @worldyouthfestival on your posted twibbon on Instagram or any other social media platform.&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n&lt;li&gt;Share the program information for the World Youth Festival &lt;a href=\"https:\/\/bit.ly\/WYF24Poster\"&gt;World Youth Fest Poster&lt;\/a&gt; with 3 WhatsApp groups or any other social media groups.&lt;\/li&gt;\r\n&lt;\/ul&gt;\r\n&lt;p&gt;Take a screenshot of each action mentioned above and upload them to your storage drive. Then, copy the link and paste it into the input forms provided above. Ensure that the folder is accessible to the public and not private.&lt;\/p&gt;\n<\/pre><\/dd><\/dl><dl><dt class=\"kint-parent\"><span class=\"kint-access-path-trigger\" title=\"Show access path\">&rlarr;<\/span><span class=\"kint-popup-trigger\" title=\"Open in new window\">&boxbox;<\/span><nav><\/nav><dfn>confirmation_desc<\/dfn> =&gt; <var>string<\/var> (1792) \" &lt;h1 style=\"color: #333;\"&gt;World Youth Festival 2024&lt;\/h1&gt; &lt;p style=\"margin-bo...<div class=\"access-path\">$value['confirmation_desc']<\/div><\/dt><dd><pre> &lt;h1 style=\"color: #333;\"&gt;World Youth Festival 2024&lt;\/h1&gt;\r\n    &lt;p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; color: #555;\"&gt;The World Youth Festival provides both &lt;strong style=\"color: #1389FD;\"&gt;Fully Funded&lt;\/strong&gt; and &lt;strong style=\"color: #1389FD;\"&gt;Self-Funded&lt;\/strong&gt; Opportunities. To qualify for &lt;strong style=\"color: #1389FD;\"&gt;Full Funding&lt;\/strong&gt;, delegates must complete all registration steps and fulfill payment by the specified deadline. If not selected for Full Funding, delegates can still participate through a self-funded scheme.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n    &lt;p style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; color: #555;\"&gt;The comprehensive expenses outlined in the World Youth Festival payment cover accommodation throughout the program (&lt;strong style=\"color: #1389FD;\"&gt;October 5 - 8, 2024&lt;\/strong&gt;), including airport transfers on the first day (&lt;strong style=\"color: #1389FD;\"&gt;October 5, 2024&lt;\/strong&gt;, for transfer from the airport to the hotel) and the last day of the program (&lt;strong style=\"color: #1389FD;\"&gt;October 8, 2024&lt;\/strong&gt;, for transfer from the hotel to the airport). It's crucial to note that all fully funded or self-funded payments do not cover flight tickets and visa expenses. The fully-funded spots will be allocated based on the registrants' quality.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n    &lt;p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; color: #555;\"&gt;With a delegate quota limited to only &lt;strong style=\"color: #1389FD;\"&gt;200 youth&lt;\/strong&gt;, let's join hands and collaborate at the World Youth Festival 2024. Your contribution is &lt;strong style=\"color: #1389FD;\"&gt;essential&lt;\/strong&gt; for a shared and &lt;strong style=\"color: #1389FD;\"&gt;impactful&lt;\/strong&gt; experience.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n    &lt;p style=\"font-style: italic; text-align: center; color: #555;\"&gt;I am &lt;strong&gt;ready&lt;\/strong&gt; to join the World Youth Festival 2024 in &lt;strong&gt;Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia&lt;\/strong&gt;.&lt;\/p&gt;\r\n  \n<\/pre><\/dd><\/dl><\/dd><\/dl><\/div>","title":"Sponsorships &amp; Partnerships","meta_title":"Sponsorships &amp; Partnerships","meta_description":"Sponsorships &amp; Partnerships","tags":"Sponsorships &amp; Partnerships","slug":"Sponsorships &amp; Partnerships"}},"headers":{"Host":"localhost:8080","Connection":"keep-alive","Cache-Control":"max-age=0","Sec-Ch-Ua":"&quot;Chromium&quot;;v=&quot;134&quot;, &quot;Not:A-Brand&quot;;v=&quot;24&quot;, &quot;Google Chrome&quot;;v=&qu